OL,3,GNEWSAMan cycles UK coastline for
OL,4,Ahospice fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has cycled 4,000 miles around the
OL,7,FUK coastline, raising around #1,500 in
OL,8,Ffunds for The Myton Hospices.
OL,10,FNorman Brown, 77, took on thousands of
OL,11,Fmiles, steep climbs and a heatwave, to
OL,12,Fsupport local people living with
OL,13,Flife-limiting illnesses and their loved
OL,14,Fones.
OL,16,FBrown, from Coventry, started his cycle
OL,17,Fin May and finished on Friday. He said
OL,18,Fhis "favourite part" was "meeting
OL,19,Fpeople along the way and sharing why I
OL,20,Fwas taking part on the challenge."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
